error[L0248]: `:part` cannot fill `{field}`
  --> expand/structural_clause_errors.rslisp:50:54
   |
50 |   (structural :struct "" :field "" :variant "" :part ".part({field})" :bare ""))
   |                                                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this template holds `{field}`
   |
   = help: `:part` takes `{value}`, and `{{` or `}}` for a literal brace

error[L0248]: `:bare` cannot fill `{2}`
  --> expand/structural_clause_errors.rslisp:54:63
   |
54 |   (structural :struct "" :field "" :variant "" :part "" :bare "{2}"))
   |                                                               ^^^^^ this template holds `{2}`
   |
   = help: `:bare` takes `{0}`, `{1}`, `{name}`, and `{{` or `}}` for a literal brace

